# Residential or mobile proxies — STRONGLY recommended for aggressive mode.
# One proxy per line. The bot rotates through this list each browser session.
#
# Formats:
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   socks5://user:pass@host:port
#
# Or set comma-separated PROXY_LIST in the environment instead:
#   export PROXY_LIST="http://u:p@proxy1:8080,http://u:p@proxy2:8080"
#
# Without proxies, all votes come from one IP (high block risk at ~400/day).
